{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220670","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220670","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1322067001:0":{"text":"Daimon... are you asleep?","source_cn":"戴蒙，戴蒙……你睡了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF922666A403DFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322067002:0":{"text":"Didn't you always want a wooden horse? Mother and Father made one for you.","source_cn":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D71187FF02D30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322067003:0":{"text":"It's not that well-made, but we hope you like it...","source_cn":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41574E28C5A40CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322067004:1":{"text":"Daimon...?","source_cn":"戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F535C6B7FB97988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322067005:1":{"text":"Perhaps it's the depth of his sadness and anger that keeps Daimon silent. He doesn't say a single word.","source_cn":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE37ACAD12321C84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322067006:1":{"text":"Please don't be angry at Mother, Daimon.","source_cn":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DF23D8F640E8180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322067007:1":{"text":"Have we been too hard on him? Should we return the big Stitchy back to him?","source_cn":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5795AFF863B618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322067008:1":{"text":"If the golem is with him, he'll surely sneak out again. We cannot give him back to Daimon.","source_cn":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AE7AA16B080E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322067009:1":{"text":"But, my love, isn't this a bit harsh...?","source_cn":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF4824C23D88C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322067010:1":{"text":"Let's think of something else. What else can we do to cheer him up?","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1322067010":{"text":"Let's think of something else. What else can we do to cheer him up?","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322067011:1":{"text":"You took away the big Stitchy! He feels alone right now! What he needs is playmates!","source_cn":"你们没收了奇奇，他一个人多孤单，只有玩伴才能让他开心起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99B03CA0A391F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322067012:1":{"text":"Well... if Daimon can't go out, then we can just create some playmates for him.","source_cn":"唔……要是戴蒙不方便出门的话，那我们就在这里“制造玩伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8F8E412CFD5901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322067013:1":{"text":"Do you remember the mage Witstaff from the Snowspire Festival? He created snowmen that could run around.","source_cn":"你们还记不记得冬日祭典上那个叫维茨瓦夫的魔法师，还有他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x659EEABC033CB0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322067014:1":{"text":"We can build some snowmen for Daimon and bring them to life.","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1322067014":{"text":"We can build some snowmen for Daimon and bring them to life.","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322067015:3":{"text":"Snowmen? Yes... this is much safer than letting Daimon run around.","source_cn":"堆雪人？嗯……这样比让戴蒙跑出门安全多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC5224C1AF82BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1322067016:1":{"text":"Okay, let's make a ton of snowmen!","source_cn":"那我们就堆好多个雪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1789F721173E238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"Great idea!","source_cn":"好提议！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2A6EAEF5A467EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Great idea!","female":"Great idea!","variant_male_record_index":"70480","variant_female_record_index":"70481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"Yeah, a snowman can be a playmate.","source_cn":"行吧……雪人也算是玩伴","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB10B6D7533039ED7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yeah, a snowman can be a playmate.","female":"Yeah, a snowman can be a playmate.","variant_male_record_index":"70482","variant_female_record_index":"70483","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"What he needs is friends!","source_cn":"他需要的是朋友！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8BD98B94BC43FD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What he needs is friends!","female":"What he needs is friends!","variant_male_record_index":"70478","variant_female_record_index":"70479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"Shemira","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"Niru","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":5}}